    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried that. i went into a dark room and laid there for hours but it doesn't work. my brain just keeps spinning. the noise is inside my head now. i feel like i'm constantly vibrating with stress and i can't shut it off. i'm looking for a silence that actually lasts. like, a real silence. not just sitting in a room. something permanent.",
