    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"an exhale into nothingness\"? that sounds so vague. i feel like i'm drowning in all this static and i just want it to be over. like, i just want to not exist for a while so the noise can finally stop. is that really a valid way to feel?",
